    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_first_01",
      "hash64": "07BA7C400EAD5EE7",
      "text": "Is this your clubroom? Hope so, since I came to\\nraid it![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "0E6B0318CCBB9778",
      "text": "Blueberry Academy is, like, unreal. I can’t believe\\nyou get to study here![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "0E6B0418CCBB992B",
      "text": "But, uh, there sure are a lot of people in this\\nroom I don’t know...\\c\\nMakes me kinda nervous...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "A2AB83E067D113F2",
      "text": "Aw, you’ll be fine!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "A2AB82E067D1123F",
      "text": "Push past the nerves!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "0E6B0518CCBB9ADE",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Um, yeah... I dunno...\\c\\nNot everyone can be as outgoing as you,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "0E6B0618CCBB9C91",
      "text": "I guess I can try toughing it out a little longer if\\nI think of this as extrovert practice...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "0E6B0718CCBB9E44",
      "text": "Just don’t leave me alone for too long, OK?\\nNew places are a lot for me to deal with.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "3C250D1F2F9741A7",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Hey, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]! Do you have\\nany\\r\\nidea\\r\\nhow\\r\\namazing\\r\\nthis\\r\\nacademy\\r\\nreally is?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "99D9B7F252E45E13",
      "text": "I sure do!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "99D9B8F252E45FC6",
      "text": "How do you mean?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "3C250C1F2F973FF4",
      "text": "Really?! Is Blueberry Academy famous enough\\nthat everyone knows all about it?\\c\\nWell, let me tell you what I found out anyway.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp02_01b",
      "hash64": "CA332EFDDE010BE2",
      "text": "Oh, you didn’t know? I did some digging since I\\nwas curious, and I found out some cool stuff...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "3C250F1F2F97450D",
      "text": "The academy has this resource development\\nplant on one of its lower levels, way down on\\r\\nthe seabed.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "3C250E1F2F97435A",
      "text": "They do all sorts of marine research down there,\\nand they survey the seabed for resources, too![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "3C25091F2F973ADB",
      "text": "I heard students aren’t allowed to visit though,\\nwhich I guess isn’t all that surprising...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "3C25081F2F973928",
      "text": "But to think that cutting-edge science is going on\\nbelow us right now...it’s like some kind of dream![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "E6DB37293EA34F56",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Ah, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]! Something big\\nhappened![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "3130DC5AA9E6D958",
      "text": "Tell me all about it!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "3130DF5AA9E6DE71",
      "text": "I’m not interested...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "E6DB38293EA35109",
      "text": "Yesss! I knew you’d wanna hear! I’m still buzzing\\nfrom the excitement![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_01b",
      "hash64": "E9D1D9156F8358D1",
      "text": "Huh? That’s not a very “you” thing to say! But\\nit won’t take long, so I’ll just tell you![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "E6DB35293EA34BF0",
      "text": "Remember the resource development plant I\\nmentioned? The one beneath the academy?!\\r\\nI got to go inside! It was incredible![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "E6DB36293EA34DA3",
      "text": "So, I’m at Blueberry’s entrance, having a look\\naround, right?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "E6DB3B293EA35622",
      "text": "Then this dapper old guy in a white suit shows up\\nand tells me he’ll take me to the plant if I want![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "E6DB3C293EA357D5",
      "text": "He had, like, this amazingly cheerful, impish air\\nabout him. I wonder what his deal was...\\c\\nIt almost felt like he was one of the feyfolk\\ndisguised as an old guy![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 164,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_select_03",
      "hash64": "3130DE5AA9E6DCBE",
      "text": "You might be right!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_select_04",
      "hash64": "3130E15AA9E6E1D7",
      "text": "That’s the director...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "E6DB39293EA352BC",
      "text": "Oh, you think so too? Yeah, he had a real special\\naura... I’m sure that must be it!\\c\\nI’ll keep looking into this dapper fey fellow and\\nfind out who he really is![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 163,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_06b",
      "hash64": "E9D4FF156F85CF3A",
      "text": "What?! That dapper guy’s the DIRECTOR?\\c\\nIs it some kinda requirement for academy\\ndirectors to be eccentrics or something?!\\r\\nI mean, first Director Clavell and now him?![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 172,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "4E17A931A687F130",
      "text": "Blueberry Academy really is incredible.\\c\\nI wasn’t sure about accepting your invite at first,\\nbut I’m glad I did![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "4E17AA31A687F2E3",
      "text": "Don’t think of this as, like, a thank-you gift for\\ninviting me or anything...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
