      "hash64": "7ADCE8A95190B3F6",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]The [VAR 0x0101(0001)] you traded me is getting\\non\\r\\ngreat\\r\\nwith\\r\\nmy\\r\\nVeevees![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
